<title>USA: Boeing shareholders approve McDonnell Douglas deal.</title>
<headline>Boeing shareholders approve McDonnell Douglas deal.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boeing Co.  shareholders on Friday approved the $15 billion merger between the aerospace giant and McDonnell Douglas Corp..</p>
<p>Over 99 percent of voting shareholders approved the deal, the company said at a special meeting of shareholders.</p>
</text>
